            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir while döngüsünün kodunu tekrarlama sayısını kontrol etmeyi inceleyelim; tıpkı bir döngü kullanarak birkaç kamerayı görüntüleyen bu sayfa gibi.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    min-height: 440px;&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   input {&#xA;    height: 25px;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   em,&#xA;   h3,&#xA;   #slider {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div style=&quot;display: inline-block; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&#xA;   &lt;em&gt;Move the input element below&lt;/em&gt;&#xA;   &lt;h3&gt;Items per page: &lt;span id=&quot;itemsPerPage&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;   &lt;div id=&quot;slider&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 25px;&quot;&gt;1 &lt;input min=&quot;1&quot;&#xA;     max=&quot;10&quot; oninput=&quot;generateList(this.value);&quot; type=&quot;range&quot;&#xA;     value=&quot;3&quot;&gt; 10&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;   &lt;ol id=&quot;list&quot;&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   generateList(3);&#xA;   &#xA;   function generateList(itemCount) {&#xA;    const itemsPerPage = document.getElementById(&quot;itemsPerPage&quot;);&#xA;    itemsPerPage.innerHTML = itemCount;&#xA;    const list = document.getElementById(&quot;list&quot;);&#xA;    list.innerHTML = &quot;&quot;;&#xA;    let counter = 1;&#xA;    while (counter &lt;= itemCount) {&#xA;     const item = document.createElement(&quot;li&quot;);&#xA;     item.innerHTML =&#xA;      '&lt;img src=&quot;https://mimo.app/i/camera.png&quot; height=25&gt; Camera';&#xA;     list.appendChild(item);&#xA;     counter++;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
