          {
            "title": "While Loops",
            "id": 78402,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>while</code> döngüsünün tekrarlanma sayısını kontrol etmek için bir sayıya ayarlanmış bir değişkenle başlarız. Bu değişkene <strong>sayaç değişkeni</strong> adını veririz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>1</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "While Loops",
            "id": 78391,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ardından, koşulda sayaç değişkenini bir sayıyla karşılaştırmak için bir karşılaştırma kullanırız. Bu durumda <code>counter &lt; 4:</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>counter</code>, ardından <code>&lt;</code> ve sonra <code>4</code>, <code>:</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Koşulda sayaç değişkenini bir sayıyla karşılaştırmak için bir karşılaştırma kullanırız.</p><p>Sayaç <code>4</code>'ten küçükken döngüyü çalıştır. Sola <code>counter</code>, sağa sayıyı yaz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>counter</code>, ardından <code>&lt;</code>, <code>4</code> ve son olarak <code>:</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "While Loops",
            "id": 78389,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kod bloğunun içinde, koşulu <code>False</code> döndürecek şekilde ayarlıyor ve sayaç değişkenini artırarak döngüyü durduruyoruz.</p><p>Bu durumda <code>+=</code>, döngü her çalıştığında <code>counter</code> değişkeninin değerini <code>1</code> artırır. <code>counter += 1</code> ile dene.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"63\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>counter += 1</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Changing the condition",
            "id": 78386,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Koşulu değiştirmek, döngüye ne zaman duracağını söyler. Örneğin koşulu <code>counter &lt; 10</code> olarak değiştirebilirsin.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"31\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>counter &lt; 10</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Changing the counter variable",
            "id": 78385,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sayaç değişkeninin değerini değiştirmek, döngünün ne zaman başlayacağını değiştirir. Örneğin <code>counter</code> değerini <code>5</code> olarak ayarlamak gibi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>5</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Code in the code block",
            "id": 78387,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kodunun sırası, konsolun ne görüntülediğini etkiler. Konsolda <code>6</code> ile <code>10</code> arasındaki sayıları görüntülemek için önce <code>counter += 1</code> kodunu yerleştir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"65\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"10\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>counter += 1</code>, ardından <code>print(counter)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İki satırın sırası, neyin görüntüleneceğini belirler. Döngü <code>6</code> ile <code>10</code> arasındaki sayıları yazdıracak şekilde satırları düzenle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"65\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"10\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>counter += 1</code>, ardından <code>print(counter)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
