            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>counter += 1</code> ne yapar?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Döngü kod bloğunu her çalıştırdığında <code>counter</code>'ı bir artırır</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">counter değişkenini oluşturur</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Döngü kod bloğunu her çalıştırdığında <code>counter</code>'ı bir artırır.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>counter += 1</code> bu döngünün sonunda durmasına nasıl yardımcı olur?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>counter &lt; 10</code> ifadesi <code>False</code> olana kadar <code>counter</code> değerini artırır.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Her tekrardan sonra <code>counter</code> değerini <code>1</code> olarak sıfırlar.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Döngünün içinde yeni bir <code>counter</code> değişkeni oluşturur.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>counter &lt; 10</code> ifadesi <code>False</code> olana kadar <code>counter</code> değerini artırır.</p></body></html>",
