            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code>'den <code>4</code>'e kadar olan sayılar</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code> ile <code>10</code> arasındaki sayılar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>1</code>'den <code>4</code>'e kadar olan sayılar.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu döngü neden <code>4</code> değerini yazdırır ancak <code>5</code> değerini yazdırmaz?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>5</code> değerinde, blok çalışmadan önce <code>counter &lt; 5</code> koşulu <code>False</code> olur.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Python her döngüyü dört tekrardan sonra otomatik olarak durdurur.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Güncelleme, <code>counter</code> değerini doğrudan <code>4</code> değerinden <code>6</code> değerine değiştirir.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>5</code> değerinde, blok çalışmadan önce <code>counter &lt; 5</code> koşulu <code>False</code> olur.</p></body></html>"
