            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İlk satırı <code>speed = 3</code> olarak değiştirsen döngü hangi sayıları gösterirdi?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" speed &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(speed)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  speed += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>3</code>'ten <code>4</code>'e kadar</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code>'den <code>4</code>'e kadar</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code>'ten <code>5</code>'e kadar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>3</code>'ten <code>4</code>'e kadar öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
